---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+14102474567';
const phoneDisplay = '(410) 247-4567';
---
<Layout>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container hero-grid">
      <div>
        <div class="hero-badge">● CATONSVILLE &amp; ARBUTUS · 24 / 7 EMERGENCY SERVICE</div>
        <h1>GARAGE DOOR<br />REPAIR IN <span>CATONSVILLE</span></h1>
        <p class="hero-sub">Fast Fixes. Reliable Service. Same-Day Response.</p>
        <p class="hero-desc">When your garage door fails in Catonsville or Arbutus, you need it fixed fast. Our licensed technicians deliver expert repairs, new installations, opener service, and spring replacements with upfront pricing and a workmanship guarantee.</p>
        <div class="hero-tags">
          <span class="hero-tag">⏱ Same-Day Response</span>
          <span class="hero-tag">🛡 Licensed &amp; Insured</span>
          <span class="hero-tag">✓ Upfront Pricing</span>
          <span class="hero-tag">📞 24 / 7 Emergency</span>
          <span class="hero-tag">🛡 Workmanship Guarantee</span>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-ctas">
          <a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call {phoneDisplay}</a>
          <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn-outline">Get a Free Quote</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-visual">
        <div class="hero-card">
          <div class="hero-card-icon">🚪</div>
          <h3>Door Stuck or Broken?</h3>
          <p>We diagnose and repair sectional, roll-up, and custom doors the same day in most cases — springs, cables, openers, and more.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Why Us -->
  <section class="section section-alt" id="why">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>Why Catonsville Homeowners <span>Choose Us</span></h2>
        <p>Your garage door is one of the largest moving parts of your home. When it fails, you need a local specialist who shows up fast and fixes it right the first time.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="features-grid">
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">⚡</div>
          <h3>Same-Day Diagnosis &amp; Repair</h3>
          <p>Most garage door repair calls in Catonsville and Arbutus are completed the same day — no multi-day waits for common spring, cable, or opener issues.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">📜</div>
          <h3>Licensed &amp; Insured</h3>
          <p>Every technician is trained on residential and light commercial doors, torsion and extension springs, and major opener brands including LiftMaster, Genie, and Chamberlain.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">💵</div>
          <h3>Upfront Pricing, Zero Surprises</h3>
          <p>We quote before we start. No hidden fees, no pressure — honest garage door repair and installation at fair local rates.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">📍</div>
          <h3>Local to Arbutus &amp; Catonsville</h3>
          <p>Based near 1404 Parker Rd in Arbutus — we know Baltimore County homes, common door styles, and the weather that wears out springs and weather seals.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="stats-row">
        <div class="stat-item"><strong>Fast</strong><span>Avg. Response</span></div>
        <div class="stat-item"><strong>High</strong><span>First-Visit Fix Rate</span></div>
        <div class="stat-item"><strong>24/7</strong><span>Emergency Available</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Problems preview -->
  <section class="section" id="problems">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>Recognize <span>These Signs?</span></h2>
        <p>Garage doors take daily abuse. If yours shows any of these symptoms, call before a small issue becomes a safety hazard or total failure.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="problems-grid">
        <a href="/problems/door-wont-open/" class="problem-card" style="display:block">
          <span class="problem-badge badge-urgent">Urgent</span>
          <h3>Door Won't Open</h3>
          <p>Complete failure to open often means a broken spring, snapped cable, or motor issue. Same-day service restores access fast.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/problems/broken-spring/" class="problem-card" style="display:block">
          <span class="problem-badge badge-urgent">Urgent</span>
          <h3>Broken Spring</h3>
          <p>A loud bang and a door that won't lift is classic spring failure. We replace torsion and extension springs safely and correctly.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/problems/noisy-door/" class="problem-card" style="display:block">
          <span class="problem-badge badge-soon">Address Soon</span>
          <h3>Noisy Garage Door</h3>
          <p>Squeaking, grinding, or rattling usually means worn rollers, dry hinges, or loose hardware. Lubrication and parts keep it quiet.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/problems/remote-not-working/" class="problem-card" style="display:block">
          <span class="problem-badge badge-soon">Address Soon</span>
          <h3>Remote Not Working</h3>
          <p>Dead batteries, programming loss, or antenna issues are common. We diagnose openers and remotes from all major brands.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/problems/door-off-track/" class="problem-card" style="display:block">
          <span class="problem-badge badge-urgent">Urgent</span>
          <h3>Door Off Track</h3>
          <p>A door that has jumped the track is unsafe. We realign tracks, replace rollers, and inspect for related damage.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/problems/opener-issues/" class="problem-card" style="display:block">
          <span class="problem-badge badge-monitor">Check</span>
          <h3>Opener Issues</h3>
          <p>Slow, weak, or unresponsive openers may need sensors, force adjustment, or full replacement for modern safety features.</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Services -->
  <section class="section section-alt" id="services">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>Our <span>Garage Door Services</span></h2>
        <p>From emergency spring replacement to full door and opener installation — we handle residential garage doors across Catonsville, Arbutus, and nearby communities.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="services-grid">
        <div class="service-card">
          <div class="service-label">Most Requested</div>
          <h3>Garage Door Repair</h3>
          <p>Springs, cables, rollers, hinges, tracks, weather seals, and panels. We diagnose the root cause and repair with quality parts.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Torsion &amp; extension springs</li>
            <li>Cables, rollers, hinges</li>
            <li>Track realignment</li>
            <li>Panel &amp; seal replacement</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/services/garage-door-repair/" class="btn btn-outline-dark">Learn More</a>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
          <div class="service-label">New &amp; Replacement</div>
          <h3>Garage Door Installation</h3>
          <p>New insulated steel, carriage-house style, and custom doors sized and installed for Baltimore County homes and weather.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Insulated steel doors</li>
            <li>Carriage &amp; wood styles</li>
            <li>Proper balancing</li>
            <li>Weather sealing</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/services/garage-door-installation/" class="btn btn-outline-dark">Learn More</a>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
          <div class="service-label">Motors &amp; Remotes</div>
          <h3>Opener Repair &amp; Install</h3>
          <p>LiftMaster, Genie, Chamberlain, and other brands. We repair sensors, logic boards, and install modern quiet belt-drive units.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Sensor &amp; board repair</li>
            <li>New opener installation</li>
            <li>Remote &amp; keypad programming</li>
            <li>Safety feature upgrades</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/services/opener-repair/" class="btn btn-outline-dark">Learn More</a>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
          <div class="service-label">High Tension</div>
          <h3>Spring Repair</h3>
          <p>Broken springs are dangerous. We safely replace torsion and extension springs, match wire size and turns, and rebalance the door.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Torsion spring replacement</li>
            <li>Extension spring systems</li>
            <li>Proper winding &amp; balance</li>
            <li>Safety cable checks</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/services/spring-repair/" class="btn btn-outline-dark">Learn More</a>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
          <div class="service-label">24 / 7</div>
          <h3>Emergency Service</h3>
          <p>Door stuck open or closed at night? We offer emergency response for unsafe or non-working doors across our service area.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>After-hours response</li>
            <li>Stuck open / closed doors</li>
            <li>Safety-critical failures</li>
            <li>Temporary secure options</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/services/emergency-service/" class="btn btn-outline-dark">Learn More</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Process -->
  <section class="section" id="process">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>How It <span>Works</span></h2>
        <p>Simple, transparent process from call to completed repair or installation.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="process-steps">
        <div class="process-step">
          <div class="step-num">1</div>
          <div>
            <h3>Call or Request a Quote</h3>
            <p>Reach us at {phoneDisplay}. Describe the issue — stuck door, broken spring, noisy operation, or new install. We schedule a convenient time, often same-day.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step">
          <div class="step-num">2</div>
          <div>
            <h3>On-Site Diagnosis &amp; Upfront Quote</h3>
            <p>We inspect the door, springs, cables, tracks, and opener. You get a clear written quote before any work begins — no surprises.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step">
          <div class="step-num">3</div>
          <div>
            <h3>Repair or Install</h3>
            <p>We complete the repair or installation with quality parts, correct balancing, and safety checks. Most common repairs finish in a single visit.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step">
          <div class="step-num">4</div>
          <div>
            <h3>Test &amp; Guarantee</h3>
            <p>We test operation, demonstrate features, and stand behind the workmanship. You leave with a door that opens and closes smoothly and safely.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Service Area map-ish -->
  <section class="section section-alt" id="areas">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>Serving <span>Catonsville &amp; Beyond</span></h2>
        <p>Proudly serving Catonsville, Arbutus, Halethorpe, Ellicott City, and surrounding Baltimore County communities from our Arbutus base.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="map-info">
        <h3>📍 1404 Parker Rd, Arbutus, MD 21227</h3>
        <p>Serving Catonsville · Arbutus · Halethorpe · Ellicott City · Woodlawn · Lansdowne · Baltimore and nearby areas.</p>
        <p style="margin-top:1rem"><a href="/service-areas/" class="btn btn-outline-dark">View All Service Areas</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="section" style="background: var(--bg-dark); color: white; text-align: center; padding: 4rem 0;">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 style="color: white; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Need Garage Door Help Today?</h2>
      <p style="color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto 1.5rem;">Same-day and emergency service available. Call now for fast, honest help in Catonsville and Arbutus.</p>
      <a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary" style="font-size: 1.15rem;">📞 Call {phoneDisplay}</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
